Open the selected entry in \fBList\fP or \fBTree\fP mode, both locally and remotely. A selected directory is entered, while a selected file is opened. When a directory is selected in \fBTree\fP mode, establish that directory as the new browsing root. During an SSH session, Enter still activates a single, selected file, or enters the selected directory. Multiple files cannot be opened simultaneously.
